{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <u><i><strong>Miniature Shop Simulator</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an engaging and detailed simulation game in which you take on the role of the owner of a shop with miniature painting shop. Your goal is to build a dream place for hobby enthusiasts, from selling kits, through painting and collecting miniatures, to developing the entire business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/2a1c58148b4bc549935acf7a796b2e9c.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/2a1c58148b4bc549935acf7a796b2e9c.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/2a1c58148b4bc549935acf7a796b2e9c.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <u><i><strong>Paint Models</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your miniatures however you like. Use different colors and types of paints, show off your painting techniques, and take advantage of all available tools to give each model its own unique look. Create your own collections and display them in the shop to inspire visitors and attract collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/8a63e488f09e11997250637f5d6881eb.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/8a63e488f09e11997250637f5d6881eb.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/8a63e488f09e11997250637f5d6881eb.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <u><i><strong>Manage the Shop</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell various miniature kits, restock shelves so they\u2019re never empty. Make sure customers can find what they\u2019re looking for, and set the right prices so they buy more and return often. Keep track of market trends to bring in the most popular sets and attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/16b519c32e4a0a6ab0774288f18f4bec.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/16b519c32e4a0a6ab0774288f18f4bec.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/16b519c32e4a0a6ab0774288f18f4bec.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f <u><i><strong>Collect Miniatures</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all! Open kits and add models to your collection. You can paint collected miniatures to sell them for an even higher price or display your best pieces in showcases to draw in more customers. Gather every model to become a true legend among collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/e0717402e596f770e6b60dbcfa91fde1.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/e0717402e596f770e6b60dbcfa91fde1.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/e0717402e596f770e6b60dbcfa91fde1.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf8d <u><i><strong>Develop and Personalize the Shop</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop, add more shelves for goods, and provide play areas for customers. Increase the shop\u2019s space to host even more visitors. Change the interior design, add decorations, and showcase your best miniatures. Your decisions will influence how customers perceive your place and how eagerly they\u2019ll return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/b0b83a13ac52c4065d56191e682d2390.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/b0b83a13ac52c4065d56191e682d2390.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/b0b83a13ac52c4065d56191e682d2390.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Can you build a shop that will become a legend among miniature enthusiasts?!</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/998bfc961f8c6f9812808f67a530354a.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1100 height=400 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462240?t=1764622614","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/c3d3d515cec181b73767c22822b47b4762cdcdf1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764622614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/8c651519087f7b22fcafcd13de6e2b2d8af6cb11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764622614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/8c651519087f7b22fcafcd13de6e2b2d8af6cb11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764622614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <u><i><strong>Miniature Shop Simulator</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an engaging and detailed simulation game in which you take on the role of the owner of a shop with miniature painting shop. Your goal is to build a dream place for hobby enthusiasts, from selling kits, through painting and collecting miniatures, to developing the entire business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/2a1c58148b4bc549935acf7a796b2e9c.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/2a1c58148b4bc549935acf7a796b2e9c.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/2a1c58148b4bc549935acf7a796b2e9c.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <u><i><strong>Paint Models</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint your miniatures however you like. Use different colors and types of paints, show off your painting techniques, and take advantage of all available tools to give each model its own unique look. Create your own collections and display them in the shop to inspire visitors and attract collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/8a63e488f09e11997250637f5d6881eb.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/8a63e488f09e11997250637f5d6881eb.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/8a63e488f09e11997250637f5d6881eb.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <u><i><strong>Manage the Shop</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell various miniature kits, restock shelves so they\u2019re never empty. Make sure customers can find what they\u2019re looking for, and set the right prices so they buy more and return often. Keep track of market trends to bring in the most popular sets and attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/16b519c32e4a0a6ab0774288f18f4bec.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/16b519c32e4a0a6ab0774288f18f4bec.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/16b519c32e4a0a6ab0774288f18f4bec.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f <u><i><strong>Collect Miniatures</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all! Open kits and add models to your collection. You can paint collected miniatures to sell them for an even higher price or display your best pieces in showcases to draw in more customers. Gather every model to become a true legend among collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/e0717402e596f770e6b60dbcfa91fde1.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/e0717402e596f770e6b60dbcfa91fde1.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/e0717402e596f770e6b60dbcfa91fde1.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf8d <u><i><strong>Develop and Personalize the Shop</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop, add more shelves for goods, and provide play areas for customers. Increase the shop\u2019s space to host even more visitors. Change the interior design, add decorations, and showcase your best miniatures. Your decisions will influence how customers perceive your place and how eagerly they\u2019ll return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/b0b83a13ac52c4065d56191e682d2390.poster.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/b0b83a13ac52c4065d56191e682d2390.webm?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/b0b83a13ac52c4065d56191e682d2390.mp4?t=1764622614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i><strong>Can you build a shop that will become a legend among miniature enthusiasts?!</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/extras/998bfc961f8c6f9812808f67a530354a.avif?t=1764622614\" width=1100 height=400 /></span></p>","developers":["Tutel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462240/a2437823820fdb7eee3331cef173b58bfe63558e/header.jpg?t=1764622614","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3462240/2074910570/b9fbb7546a924b209a30e8b2385ceed7687089cc/1764373878/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764462812","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3462240/2074910570/b9fbb7546a924b209a30e8b2385ceed7687089cc/1764373878/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764462812","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3462240/2074910570/b9fbb7546a924b209a30e8b2385ceed7687089cc/1764373878/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764462812","id":257240219,"name":"Miniature Shop Simulator - Early Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257240219/0718e91551a2391bcc07faa6c703239b8742e017/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764462812"}],"name":"Miniature Shop Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 3550 / RYZEN 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AM